# 文本文件统一按 LF 保存，避免跨平台检出时产生无意义差异
* text=auto
*.m text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
*.csv text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.xml text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf

# 课程材料和实验产物按二进制处理
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
*.pptx binary
*.ppt binary
*.mat binary
*.fig binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.mp4 binary

